        {
         "id": "67004d5c",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "<p>Lenz Heating &amp; Cooling is proud to serve the same Central Iowa communities we call home. Our work starts with heating, cooling, and indoor air quality, but our commitment does not stop there.</p><p>From Des Moines and Urbandale to Creston, Winterset, Madison County, and surrounding communities, we believe local businesses should help strengthen the neighborhoods, schools, families, and organizations that support them. Whether we are helping a family through Operation Lenz a Helping Hand, supporting youth sports, partnering with local small businesses, or contributing to school programs, our goal is simple: show up, give back, and help make Central Iowa a better place to live.</p>",
          "_css_classes": "hero__sub"
         },
         "elements": [],
         "isInner": true,
         "widgetType": "text-editor",
         "elType": "widget"
        },
