        {
         "id": "6702918e",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "<p>As a local heating and cooling company, we spend a lot of time inside homes across Central Iowa. We see how important comfort, safety, and trust are for families, seniors, schools, small businesses, and local neighborhoods.</p><p>That same mindset guides our community outreach. Lenz Heating &amp; Cooling believes in doing honest work, supporting local relationships, and finding practical ways to give back to the communities that have supported us over the years.</p>",
          "_css_classes": "prose__body"
         },
         "elements": [],
