            "typography_typography": "custom",
            "_css_classes": "promo__title"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "heading",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "6702f241",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p><b>Helping Neighbors Stay Safe and Comfortable</b> </p><p>Operation Lenz a Helping Hand was created to help individuals or families who do not have the means to purchase the heating and cooling systems they need.</p><p>For many households, a working furnace or air conditioner is not just about comfort. It can affect safety, health, and peace of mind. Through this program, Lenz Heating &amp; Cooling works with suppliers to find ways to install new heating and cooling systems at no cost to the client when support is available.</p><p>This program reflects the heart of our community outreach: using the work we do every day to help a neighbor stay warm in winter, cool in summer, and safe at home.</p>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          }
