         "elements": [],
         "isInner": true,
         "widgetType": "heading",
         "elType": "widget"
        },
        {
         "id": "67038cf9",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "<p>Lenz Heating &amp; Cooling values opportunities to support young people, school programs, and family-centered activities throughout the communities we serve.</p><p>We are proud to sponsor local youth sports programs, including <b>UGRA 12U J-Hawks Softball</b> and <b>DCG Youth Flag Football</b>. Supporting youth teams gives us a chance to encourage teamwork, community pride, and family involvement beyond the work we do in homes.</p><p>We also support the <b>Creston Booster Club</b> through direct donations and fun halftime giveaways at Creston High School Basketball games.</p><p>Lenz Heating &amp; Cooling also works closely with the <b>Saint Malachy SCRIP Program</b>, which helps raise money for Saint Malachy School through gift card donations. The program also works with individual Creston residents to help cover HVAC costs, with a percentage of those costs going back to the school, specifically toward student tuition accounts. Lenz also participates in the annual Saint Malachy SCRIP Auction.</p><p><b>Web Dev Design note:</b> Use this section for a clean partner-card or logo layout. Each card should include the organization name, a short description, and a link if available.</p>",
          "_css_classes": "prose__body"
         },
