          "editor": "<p>Strong communities are built through local relationships. Lenz Heating &amp; Cooling is proud to stay connected with organizations, businesses, and community groups that help Central Iowa grow.</p><p>We are proud members of the <b>Urbandale Chamber of Commerce</b> and the <b>Creston Chamber of Commerce</b>. These relationships help us stay involved with local business owners, community leaders, and the people who make our service areas feel like home.</p><p><b>Web Dev Design note:</b> Use this section for a clean partner-card or logo layout. Each card should include the organization name, a short description, and a link if available.</p>",
          "_css_classes": "prose__body"
