        {
         "id": "6704750d",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "<p>Central Iowa has given Lenz Heating &amp; Cooling an incredible amount of support, and #WinningWednesday is one way we give back.</p><p>Through these weekly giveaways, we provide opportunities for community members to win special prizes while also helping promote local small businesses. When possible, we partner with business owners who donate toward the giveaway, and in return, we help spotlight their business through our Facebook page.</p><p>It is a simple way to celebrate local support, introduce neighbors to small businesses, and keep community connection fun.</p>",
